1
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Saving the world, one enemy at a time.

2
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:06,000
Ultimate Avengers: The Movie is a action, animation,
family film directed by Curt Geda.

3
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
When a nuclear missile was fired at Washington in 1945, Captain
America managed to detonate it in the upper atmosphere.

4
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
But then he fell miles into the icy depths of the North
Atlantic, where he remained lost for over sixty years.

5
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
But now, with the world facing the very same evil, Captain
America must rise again as our last hope for survival.

6
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Steve Rogers / Captain America (voice), played by Justin Gross.

7
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Janet Pym / The Wasp (voice), played by Grey DeLisle.

8
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Hank Pym / Giant Man (voice), played by Nolan North.

9
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Natalia Romanoff / Black Widow (voice), played by Olivia D'Abo.

10
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Tony Stark / Iron Man (voice), played by Marc Worden.

11
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
Bruce Banner (voice), played by Michael Massee.

12
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Ultimate Avengers: The Movie (also known simply as Ultimate Avengers) is a 2006 American
animated superhero film based on the Ultimates comic book series by Marvel Comics.

13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
The film is the first installment in the Marvel Animated Features (MAF) film series, and follows
Captain America, who is de-thawed and recruited by Nick Fury to fight an alien race.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Premiering on February 7, 2006, at WonderCon, Ultimate Avengers was
released direct-to-video in the United States on February 21.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
A sequel to the film, titled Ultimate Avengers 2: Rise of the Panther, premiered at San-Diego
Comic Con on July 22, 2006, five months after the first film was released.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The film explores themes of mask, superhero, alien
life-form, based on comic, alien.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
